If you remember this great turn-based strategy game, you are probably
as excited as I am to hear that Stardock (galactic civilisations) is
most probably going to make the sequel: Master of Magic 2. A lot of
people have been waiting for this for ten years.
Stardock is in negotiations with Atari, who have the rights of the old
Microprose/Simtex game.
It was arguably the best game in its category of all times. I still
play it once in a while, using the 'dosbox utility' (otherwise it
doesn't work on WinXP).

http://www.masterofmagic2.com/

